# #`/nova/extension/org.ci.reeseric
#
# Persistent URLs deep-linking to the Nova extension store for `org.ci.reeseric` apps.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by: Reese Ricci Armstrong
# Email: me@reeseric.ci

RedirectMatch 302 ^/nova/extension/org\.ci\.reeseric/ledger$ nova://extension/?id=org.ci.reeseric.ledger
RedirectMatch 302 ^/nova/extension/org\.ci\.reeseric/rego$ nova://extension/?id=org.ci.reeseric.Rego
